$ wslc.exe

`wslc.exe` enables management and interaction with → Windows/Subsystem-for-Linux[WSL] containers from the command line. It can be used to build, run and deploy Linux containers on Windows.

WSLC is the Windows Subsystem for Linux Container CLI tool.

